      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Margin",
          "value": "<p>And kindly [send] me a letter from you yourself. It is not beyond your powers [to find] someone who can deliver it to me; inform me about all his affairs. In this way, you will ease my heart and silence my weeping and relieve my burning thirst and suffering. You will do this out of mercy and kindness from you. And the heartiest of greetings to my lord and master.</p>\n<p>[The scribe:] . . . your servants send heartfelt regards to you. Give regards to Jam[ila]. And extend my greetings to your brother David and your sisters, may Go[d]\u200c . . . preserve them . . . the best regards; [and the writer X, son of] Jacob the cantor sends greetings to all of you.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
